<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Chemical bid-only on repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Chemical bid-only on repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mitsubishi Chemical Corp were bid-only in early morning trade on Wednesday, cheered by its announcement late on Monday that it plans to buy back up to 40 billion yen worth of its own stock, or up to 100 million shares, traders said.</p>
<p>As of 0028 GMT, the shares of the leading Japanese chemical company were quoted bid-only at 422 yen, above Monday's close of 407. Tuesday was a market holiday.</p>
